UID:uf6VJDv8wBmCCLtUF18Ut
SUMMARY:Pier & Beam July Happy Hour
DTSTAMP:20260722T105327Z
DTSTART:20260722T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:Pier & Beam’s July Happy Hour takes us downtown on Wednesday\, 
	July 22\, for an evening at one of Houston’s most imaginative bars\, tucke
	d inside one of Main Street’s oldest commercial buildings. No Vacancy is a
	n immersive cocktail bar that transforms the space into a fictional vintag
	e roadside motel. Richly layered with crimson drapery\, patterned wallpape
	r\, vintage furnishings and playful nods to mid-century Americana\, it fee
	ls part roadside motel\, part old hotel lounge and part movie set.\n\nhttp
	s://www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2026/7/22/pier-beam-happy-hour\n\
	nFrom Preservation Houston
URL:https://www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2026/7/22/pier-beam-happy-
	hour
GEO:29.7589;-95.3677
LOCATION:No Vacancy\, 410 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:preservation-houston
CATEGORIES:Preservation Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
